{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/b6acd084599a67d5ca1713fcd9a4eb54.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/b6acd084599a67d5ca1713fcd9a4eb54.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/b6acd084599a67d5ca1713fcd9a4eb54.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Birger</strong>, a warrior bound to the fading gods of Jordenheim and armed with a colossal axe. When faiths collide and the Shroud bleeds into the mortal realm, you must carve a path through shadows, ruins, and myths to uncover the truth behind a world on the edge of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/83bf97fe54c95f8703bb888f184d2ba0.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/83bf97fe54c95f8703bb888f184d2ba0.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/83bf97fe54c95f8703bb888f184d2ba0.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Birger\u2019s Saga is a 2D action-adventure rooted in the universe of the Jordenheim tabletop RPG. Built on smooth side-scrolling combat and atmospheric exploration, it blends the feel of classic adventures with the weight of Norse legend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/9b2973c33dc9dee1d2a808f670b48511.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/9b2973c33dc9dee1d2a808f670b48511.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/9b2973c33dc9dee1d2a808f670b48511.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axe-Driven Combat</strong>: Swing heavy, dodge fast, and string together attacks that feel as sharp as they look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration with Purpose</strong>: Hidden paths, branching routes, and secrets woven into each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norse Mythology Atmosphere: Encounter foes and stories shaped by the Elder Gods and the new faiths that challenge them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Rewarding</strong>: Quick to learn, satisfying to master\u2014built for evenings where story and action meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Saga to Remember</strong>: Inspired by the Jordenheim tabletop RPG, with lore and atmosphere that carry beyond the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you once cut your teeth on Prince of Persia or are stepping into Norse myth for the first time, Birger\u2019s Saga is built for evenings where story, action, and nostalgia meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The saga begins February 2026. We will be opening<strong> Playtests</strong>\u00a0shortly, we look forward to seeing you all there!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972340?t=1757057681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/e4715f1eebb4d820628010215eae4ecd4f085a76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757057681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/587ffb01d7d95e3aeb8a7d8d96a2c8c3e43c36ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757057681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/587ffb01d7d95e3aeb8a7d8d96a2c8c3e43c36ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757057681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/b6acd084599a67d5ca1713fcd9a4eb54.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/b6acd084599a67d5ca1713fcd9a4eb54.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codec