m_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/9b2973c33dc9dee1d2a808f670b48511.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axe-Driven Combat</strong>: Swing heavy, dodge fast, and string together attacks that feel as sharp as they look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration with Purpose</strong>: Hidden paths, branching routes, and secrets woven into each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norse Mythology Atmosphere: Encounter foes and stories shaped by the Elder Gods and the new faiths that challenge them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Rewarding</strong>: Quick to learn, satisfying to master\u2014built for evenings where story and action meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Saga to Remember</strong>: Inspired by the Jordenheim tabletop RPG, with lore and atmosphere that carry beyond the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you once cut your teeth on Prince of Persia or are stepping into Norse myth for the first time, Birger\u2019s Saga is built for evenings where story, action, and nostalgia meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.poster.avif?t=1757057681\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.webm?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/extras/26dfe8a2c0838fd344b540590f40b8a5.mp4?t=1757057681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The saga begins February 2026. We will be opening<strong> Playtests</strong>\u00a0shortly, we look forward to seeing you all there!\u00a0</p>","developers":["WRKS Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972340/e002f9938c7847ca0f8ac2331462c94766fccaf5/header.jpg?t=1757057681","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188967,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188967/movie480.mp4?t=1757057679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188967/movie_max.mp4?t=1757057679"},"name":"Alpha Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188967/facfa2d36b70a62b57b0d5c841e083664caee6bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757057679","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188967/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757057679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188967/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757057679"}}],"name":"Birger's Saga","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 2000 series or higher equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 3000 series or higher equivalen<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></